{
  "id": "change-suffix",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Uzantıyı değiştir",
    "en": "Change the extension"
  },
  "difficulty": 1,
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.py",
  "solution": "solution.py",
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`Path(path).with_suffix(new)` yeni yol verir.",
      "en": "`Path(path).with_suffix(new)` gives a new path."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Sonuna `.as_posix()`.",
      "en": "Add `.as_posix()` at the end."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n\ndef change_suffix(path, new):\n    return Path(path).with_suffix(new).as_posix()\n\nprint(change_suffix(\"reports/q1.xlsx\", \".csv\"))\nprint(change_suffix(\"photo.JPG\", \".png\"))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n\ndef change_suffix(path, new):\n    return Path(path).with_suffix(new).as_posix()\n\nprint(change_suffix(\"reports/q1.xlsx\", \".csv\"))\nprint(change_suffix(\"photo.JPG\", \".png\"))\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "change_suffix",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [
            "reports/q1.xlsx",
            ".csv"
          ],
          "returns": "reports/q1.csv"
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "photo.JPG",
            ".png"
          ],
          "returns": "photo.png"
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "data/archive.tar.gz",
            ".zip"
          ],
          "returns": "data/archive.tar.zip"
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "README",
            ".md"
          ],
          "returns": "README.md"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stdout",
      "match": "trimmed_lines",
      "expected": "reports/q1.csv\nphoto.png"
    }
  ]
}
